          deckDescription: 'A 25-card pack for five players: 24 cards from a French deck (A, K, Q, J, 10, and 2 in each of four suits) plus one Joker. The 2 ranks highest of its suit when led and lowest when following; the Joker wins the trick when led and loses when following.',
